# Atlas Changelog

All notable changes to the Atlas Core are recorded here. Dates describe repository changes, not unverified personal accomplishments.

## [Unreleased]

### Added

- Structured Royal's public mission profile, current background, study commitment, fitness routine, self-assessment, and long-term vision.
- Defined Mission 001 and its completion criteria.
- Recorded the active Project Ascent phase, focus areas, next milestone, and known gaps.
- Organized the five-year roadmap into sequential learning and professional-development phases.
- Added explicit placeholders for information Royal still needs to confirm.

### Changed

- Replaced broken character encoding with readable UTF-8 punctuation.
- Clarified that roadmap dates are targets and do not represent completed accomplishments.
- Separated confirmed information from estimates and future intentions.

## July 27, 2026 — Atlas Core Established

- Added the initial Atlas context, rulebook, agent instructions, Royal profile, mission status, current task, roadmap, and changelog files.

> The pursuit of knowledge is the mission.
